      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done, but I made some guesses about the proper behavior:\n\n- Don\u0027t remove the override if our override port is a dedicated charger\n\n- Don\u0027t remove the OVERRIDE_DONT_CHARGE under any condition (except manual removal though console / host command)",
